# Base URL of the Signup.Api backend. Leave unset to use a relative path
# ("/api/signup"), which works when frontend and backend share an origin, or
# in local dev via the Vite dev-server proxy in vite.config.ts (proxies /api
# to http://localhost:5231). Set this if the backend is deployed on a
# different origin than the frontend (requires CORS to be enabled on the
# backend for that origin — not yet configured on Signup.Api as of this
# ticket).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5231
